  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2302701",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Yasmin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230270101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230270101": {
            "id": "230270101",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Looks like it does need some proper care...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270102"
            ]
          },
          "230270102": {
            "id": "230270102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you doing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270103"
            ]
          },
          "230270103": {
            "id": "230270103",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "You are... Huh. Judging by your looks, you must be a traveler, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270104"
            ]
          },
          "230270104": {
            "id": "230270104",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "I'm Yasmin, a student from Amurta. I'm here to study the Divine Tree.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270105"
            ]
          },
          "230270105": {
            "id": "230270105",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "The years this Divine Tree has seen exceed the total amount of rice grains contained in all the pilaf in Port Ormos.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270106"
            ]
          },
          "230270106": {
            "id": "230270106",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "It also holds the Akademiya up. It can be said to be as important as the vegetables at the bottom of Tandoori Roast Chicken.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270110",
              "230270109"
            ]
          },
          "230270110": {
            "id": "230270110",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "If anything untoward were to happen to it, Sumeru City in its entirety would face terrible disasters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270111"
            ]
          },
          "230270111": {
            "id": "230270111",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "It might be harried by pests, or locusts bigger than a roof might rush out from the inside...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270112"
            ]
          },
          "230270112": {
            "id": "230270112",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Or the branches might go into a growing frenzy, and the roots might sprout outward like floods from the earth, destroying every house in its path.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270113"
            ]
          },
          "230270113": {
            "id": "230270113",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Or maybe the Divine Tree might wither so very quickly that its trunk falls on half of Sumeru City, crushing everything there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270114"
            ]
          },
          "230270114": {
            "id": "230270114",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Th—Those things aren't really gonna happen, right!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270115"
            ]
          },
          "230270115": {
            "id": "230270115",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Oh, of course. Or at least, everything has been totally fine so far.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270116"
            ]
          },
          "230270116": {
            "id": "230270116",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "But then again, it's not like the fungal beasts will warn you in advance before attacking you while you gather mushrooms in the forests.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270117"
            ]
          },
          "230270117": {
            "id": "230270117",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "That's why I'm here: to observe the tree and prepare for any incidents that might come our way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270118"
            ]
          },
          "230270118": {
            "id": "230270118",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "But as you can see, my thoughts are as swift as a Dusk Bird, yet my strength is as feeble as a Starshroom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270119"
            ]
          },
          "230270119": {
            "id": "230270119",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "So, Traveler, could you help me record the condition of the Divine Tree's roots at a few locations?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270120"
            ]
          },
          "230270120": {
            "id": "230270120",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Usually, I hire adventurers to go with me, but no one seems to have been available this time around..."
          },
          "230270109": {
            "id": "230270109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, it is a great tree indeed..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302702",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the roots of the Divine Tree",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230270201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230270201": {
            "id": "230270201",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Traveler, what a coincidence. We meet again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270202"
            ]
          },
          "230270202": {
            "id": "230270202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you still doing your research?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270203"
            ]
          },
          "230270203": {
            "id": "230270203",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Yes. Ladep and Pharez requested more data, so here I am, continuing my work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270204"
            ]
          },
          "230270204": {
            "id": "230270204",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "That said, I wonder how those roots are doing right now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230270205"
            ]
          },
          "230270205": {
            "id": "230270205",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "Traveler, if you would, please help me record the conditions of the Divine Tree roots once again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2302703",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230270301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230270301": {
            "id": "230270301",
            "speakerId": 4178,
            "speakerName": "Yasmin",
            "text": "I'm counting on you this time. I'll be waiting for you here."
          }
        }
      }
